{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28,"mobile_padding_top":40,"mobile_padding_bottom":40}},"rich_text_dTaFeB":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_J749Dw":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"PIck up & delivery","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_WQjLrB":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Getting fresh food from local farmers is easy. We deliver across Brisbane, the Sunshine Coast, the Gold Coast, Tweed Heads, parts of Northern NSW, Gympie and Toowoomba.<\/strong><\/p><p><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_J749Dw","text_WQjLrB"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"image_with_text_jV7zEV":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_QeHVLB":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Free Pick Up","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_xLU8D9":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Want to save on delivery fees?<br\/>You can collect your order from one of our <strong>30+ pickup points across Brisbane with no delivery fee<\/strong>. The minimum order for pick-up is $50, and a $2 temporary fuel levy applies<br\/><\/p><p>These locations are hosted by our wonderful customers who open their homes or businesses to help make fresh food more accessible in their community.<\/p><p>Each pickup location has a scheduled delivery day. We'll send you a text message before your collection day with an estimated delivery time and another message once your order has arrived.<\/p><p>If your order includes chilled or frozen items, we pack them carefully with ice packs to keep them cold until you collect.<\/p><p>We simply ask that you collect your box within <strong>a few hours of delivery<\/strong> to keep everything fresh.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_TyT9eB":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"How Pick-up works","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/collecting-from-a-pick-up-point","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["heading_QeHVLB","text_xLU8D9","button_TyT9eB"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1-free-pick-up-organic-food-brisbane-gold-coast.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"mobile_padding_top":40,"mobile_padding_bottom":0}},"3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355":{"type":"gm-image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16844372279511__3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Home delivery","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--16844372279511__3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Of course it's often more convenient to have your order delivered to your door so we offer that too.&nbsp;<\/p><p>We do our own deliveries in the Brisbane area from Wednesday to Saturday and use refrigerated couriers to deliver to the Sunshine Coast, the Gold Coast, Tweed Heads and Northern NSW.<br\/><br\/>Home delivery is a flat rate of $12.50. For Brisbane and northern Gold Coast customers, we offer free delivery on orders over $200. A temporary fuel levy also applies: $2 for local deliveries and $4 for refrigerated courier orders.<br\/><br\/>Frozen and cold items will be packed in Styrofoam or chilltainers with ice packs. Please arrange to take them inside quickly.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16844372279511__3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355-heading-1","template--16844372279511__3f91bc16-16e6-434a-8427-9cd5fc389355-text-1"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text {padding-top: 0;}","@media (max-width: 767px) {.gm {padding: 0px 0 20px; }}"],"settings":{"bg_color":"#ffffff","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Trev_Home_Delivery_Van.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"e1a1623e-1c21-40b0-adf8-65cda35d3fc0":{"type":"map-section","custom_css":["@media (max-width: 767px) {h2 {font-size: 32px; } .about {padding-top: 20px !important; padding-bottom: 20px !important; }}"],"settings":{"bg_color":"#fffaf5","heading":"Our pick up points","paragraph":"<p>Enter your suburb below to see if we have a pick-up point near you.<\/p><p><em>Please note the time frame provided is an estimate of when our driver will arrive at the pick-up location each week. We will send a confirmation text message with a more specific time two days prior to your collection date. <\/em><\/p>","subheading":"We also offer home delivery right across Brisbane, Sunshine Coast, Gold Coast, Gympie, Toowoomba and parts of Northern NSW.","paragraph2":"<p><em>Please try to collect from our pick-up points within 5 hours to ensure your box isn't sitting out too long. It is your responsibility to remember to collect your order.<\/em><\/p>","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"table_columns_8PwV73":{"type":"table_columns","blocks":{"column_UY7TUE":{"type":"column","settings":{"column_data1":"<p>WEDNESDAY<\/p>","column_data2":"<p>ALDERLEY<\/p>","column_data3":"<p>9am - 12 noon<\/p>","column_data4":"<p>100 Mornington Street<\/p>"}},"column_qVHfET":{"type":"column","settings":{"column_data1":"<p>WEDNESDAY<\/p>","column_data2":"<p>KEDRON<\/p>","column_data3":"<p>9am - 12 noon<\/p>","column_data4":"<p>23 Eddowes Street<\/p>"}},"column_afLVmp":{"type":"column","settings":{"column_data1":"<p>WEDNESDAY<\/p>","column_data2":"<p>TARINGA<\/p>","column_data3":"<p>9am - 12 noon<\/p>","column_data4":"<p>203 Taringa Parade<\/p>"}},"column_8KfVKx":{"type":"column","settings":{"column_data1":"<p>